Id: sysd008i
Severity: INFO
Category: services
Check: check_units
References: systemd.unit(5), systemd-delta(1)

Some enabled systemd services shipped by a package are changed
locally: a unit file of the same name in /etc/systemd/system (or /run)
replaces the package's, or a drop-in there adds to it. The detail
lists each with the file. Such changes outlive package updates, so a
fix the package later makes to its unit may not take effect. 'systemctl
cat NAME' shows the result; 'systemd-delta' lists every such change.
This is informational.
